532 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The research started with a market analysis\054 including also competitors and user behaviours when paying and managing utilities\056\nNot so many people have a proper understanding of the daily cost phases Red Amber Green\054 and the importance of those when you want to reduce the cost you are paying in utilities\056\nThe difference in knowledge from end\055users will kill the idea of going live with a single product targeting 2 personas\056\n)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 533 0 R
     /Pg 524 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
