542 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The data gathered allowed me to design quickly the first set of Lo\055Fi Wireframes\054 which got almost all rejected\056\nThe second iteration set the direction for the widgets and the dashboards to be filled with them\056\nI quickly prototyped few widgets to see how they were performing live\054 and after some pain\055point solved the design was ready to be converted in a PoC)
     /K [ 9 ]
