552 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The widgets have been built using VueJS as codebase and D3js as chart library\056 The scope for the PoC was to have working widgets invoking real API on an editable dashboard\056 After 5 weeks working on it creating logics to feed the charts in realtime and developing the widget itself\054 the PoC took life and I finally connected the developed design to real API and it was working exactly as expected\041)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 553 0 R
     /Pg 524 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
